# Codec calls: one label per codec row.
label sk_codec_c01_briefing:
    $ sk_codec_open("c01_briefing")
    sk_zero "Snake, this is Major Zero. Can you hear me?"
    sk_snake "Loud and clear. Why does this forest have a school in it?"
    sk_zero "That's your target. Yamaku Academy, a Soviet boarding school for students with disabilities. On paper."
    sk_zero "Intelligence says it's a front for a long-term infiltration program. Codename: Operation Long Ramp."
    sk_snake "What's the objective?"
    sk_zero "We don't know. That's the trouble. Whatever it is, Moscow has budgeted for it until 1990."
    sk_zero "You go in as Hisao Nakai, a transfer student. Make contact with the students. Find out what they're planning."
    sk_snake "Undercover at a school. In the snow. Got it."
    $ sk_codec_close()
    return

label sk_codec_c02_ramp:
    $ sk_codec_open("c02_ramp")
    sk_snake "Major. There's a ramp at the main gate. Gold leaf."
    sk_zero "A ramp? To what end?"
    sk_snake "...To the door."
    sk_zero "Remarkable. Photograph it if you can. Washington will want to know what it costs."
    $ sk_codec_close()
    return

label sk_codec_c03_paramedic:
    $ sk_codec_open("c03_paramedic")
    sk_para "Snake, it's Para-Medic. Zero told me you met a girl who runs on prosthetic legs?"
    sk_snake "She hit me at full speed. Felt like a jeep."
    sk_para "Did you know there's a film where... no, never mind. Snake, these students aren't weak. They're adapted. Every one of them has learned to beat a world that wasn't built for them."
    sk_para "If the Soviets have trained that into a spy program, they might be the most dangerous unit you've ever faced."
    sk_snake "Great."
    $ sk_codec_close()
    return

label sk_codec_c04_zero_plan:
    $ sk_codec_open("c04_zero_plan")
    sk_snake "Major, I think I understand the plan."
    sk_zero "Go on."
    sk_snake "They want the West to build ramps. Braille signs. Lifts on buses. Everywhere. All of it."
    sk_zero "Good Lord. The cost would be astronomical."
    sk_snake "...And the worst part is, it's a good idea."
    sk_zero "That's what makes it brilliant, Snake. Get those blueprints."
    $ sk_codec_close()
    return

label sk_codec_c05_cliffhanger:
    $ sk_codec_open("c05_cliffhanger")
    sk_snake "Major, I've got them. It's legislation. An American law. They've written our law for us."
    sk_zero "Then the infiltration is already complete. Snake, get out of there. Now."
    sk_snake "Wait. Someone's—"
    $ sk_codec_close()
    return

# Scenes: one label per scene row.
label sk_scene_s01_insertion:
    $ sk_scene("op_snowywoods", "tension", [], "Virtuous Mission")
    "1964. Somewhere beyond the Iron Curtain, in a closed city the maps call \"Yamakugrad\"."
    "A parachute opens over a snowy forest. The man under it has a bandana, a knife, and a forged transfer certificate in the name of one Hisao Nakai."
    call sk_codec_c01_briefing
    "Snake stows the parachute under a pine and checks the certificate. \"Heart condition. Arrhythmia.\" Convenient. Nobody asks a sick boy too many questions."
    "{i}Press C (or the CAMO button) at any time to change camouflage. Whoever you're talking to will notice.{/i}"
    return

label sk_scene_s02_gate:
    $ sk_scene("school_gate", "normal", [], "Transfer Student")
    "The school gate looks exactly like a Japanese boarding school. That is the first thing that's wrong with it."
    "The second is the hammer and sickle worked very subtly into the ironwork. The third is the wheelchair ramp. It is beautiful. It is gold-leafed."
    sk_snake "...A ramp. Out here."
    call sk_codec_c02_ramp
    return

label sk_scene_s03_hallway:
    $ sk_scene("school_hallway3", "shizune", ['shizune', 'misha'], "The Sign")
    $ sk_show("shizune", "neutral", "twoleft")
    $ sk_show("misha", "neutral", "tworight")
    $ sk_expr("misha", "neutral")
    mi "Ah! You must be the new transfer student, Hicchan~! I'm Misha, and this is Shicchan, our class rep!"
    $ sk_expr("shizune", "neutral")
    ssh "You are late. Transfer students are never late. Spies are late."
    $ sk_expr("misha", "happy")
    mi "Shicchan says, \"Welcome!\" Wahahaha~!"
    sk_snake "That's not what her hands said."
    $ sk_expr("shizune", "shock")
    ssh "You read sign language?"
    "Snake reads a lot of things. Codebooks. Body language. The fact that Misha's \"translation\" just skipped forty words."
    $ sk_expr("misha", "neutral")
    mi "Hicchan, Shicchan wants to know if you'd like to join the student council~! We do a lot of very normal school things! Like budgets!"
    $ sk_expr("shizune", "happy")
    ssh "Very large budgets. For other countries."
    sk_snake "I'll think about it."
    $ sk_hide("shizune")
    $ sk_hide("misha")
    return

label sk_scene_s04_classroom:
    $ sk_scene("school_scienceroom", "daily", ['mutou'], "Instructor Mutovich")
