label sk_scene_s05_track:
    $ sk_scene("school_track", "emi", ['emi'], "The Stride")
    $ sk_sfx("emirunning")
    "Something hits Snake at roughly the speed of a Soviet motorcycle. He rolls with it, the way they taught him. The something does not roll. The something bounces."
    $ sk_show("emi", "angry", "center")
    $ sk_expr("emi", "angry")
    emi "Ow! Watch where you're standing! This is a running track, not a standing track!"
    sk_snake "You came out of nowhere."
    $ sk_expr("emi", "happy")
    emi "That's kind of my whole thing! Emi Ibarazaki, fastest legs in the Union. Both of them carbon fibre."
    $ sk_expr("emi", "neutral")
    emi "Our coach says the Americans will pay a fortune to make every pavement in their country flat enough for me. Every. Single. One."
    sk_snake "Why would they do that?"
    $ sk_expr("emi", "happy")
    emi "Because it's the right thing to do, silly! That's what makes it such a good plan."
