label sk_scene_s07_roof:
    $ sk_scene("school_roof", "rin", ['rin'], "The Brush")
    $ sk_show("rin", "neutral", "center")
    "On the roof, a girl with no arms is painting with her feet. The painting is enormous. The painting is a ramp."
    $ sk_expr("rin", "neutral")
    rin "You're standing in my light, but it's okay, because you're the kind of shadow I wanted."
    sk_snake "What is that?"
    $ sk_expr("rin", "neutral")
    rin "It's a mural. Or a blueprint. They told me to paint a blueprint and I said I only paint murals, so we agreed it's both."
    $ sk_expr("rin", "happy")
    rin "It's a ramp at a one-to-twelve slope. If you build a million of them, a country gets very tired."
    sk_snake "...Who told you to paint it?"
    $ sk_expr("rin", "neutral")
    rin "The student council. The blueprints are in their room. In a drawer marked \"NOT BLUEPRINTS\"."
    $ sk_hide("rin")
    call sk_codec_c04_zero_plan
